   <H1>[Python-Dev] PEP 563: Postponed Evaluation of Annotations (Draft 3)</H1>
    <B>Guido van Rossum</B> 
    <A HREF="mailto:python-dev%40python.org?Subject=Re%3A%20%5BPython-Dev%5D%20PEP%20563%3A%20Postponed%20Evaluation%20of%20Annotations%0A%20%28Draft%203%29&In-Reply-To=%3CCAP7%2BvJKZzYCaa3B29RahqmTXfgvHGS-LUVSyja_-9pzSTauOyw%40mail.gmail.com%3E"
